01:21:45.750 --> 01:21:47.208
Let's get the
hell out of here.

1029
01:22:01.083 --> 01:22:02.875
[voices]

1030
01:22:09.750 --> 01:22:10.500
Go. go!

1031
01:22:13.750 --> 01:22:15.333
Go! Go. go.
go. go. go. go!

1032
01:22:31.291 --> 01:22:32.500
Ah!!

1033
01:22:32.500 --> 01:22:33.791
Mike. come on!

1034
01:22:42.750 --> 01:22:43.958
Dammit. I'm out.

1035
01:22:52.041 --> 01:22:53.250
I'm out too.

1036
01:22:55.458 --> 01:22:56.958
(Banning) Come in!

1037
01:22:57.458 --> 01:22:58.666
Davies.

1038
01:22:58.666 --> 01:23:01.291
We're trapped!
I repeat. we are trapped.

1039
01:23:03.958 --> 01:23:05.208
Blow it.

1040
01:23:05.708 --> 01:23:07.375
Are you insane?
I can't blow it yet.

1041
01:23:07.375 --> 01:23:08.500
You're not out.

1042
01:23:08.500 --> 01:23:10.250
We're not gonna
get out unless you do!

1043
01:23:11.666 --> 01:23:14.208
Just trust me!
Now. goddammit!

1044
01:23:27.916 --> 01:23:28.916
Go. go. go!

1045
01:24:19.041 --> 01:24:21.625
Banning?
Banning. do you copy?

1046
01:24:24.583 --> 01:24:26.708
Has anyone found
any sign of them?

1047
01:24:26.708 --> 01:24:28.291
(Soldier 1) Nothing. Over.

1048
01:24:28.291 --> 01:24:29.375
(Soldier 2) Negative.

1049
01:24:29.375 --> 01:24:31.625
OK. well. stay sharp.
Keep looking.

1050
01:24:32.958 --> 01:24:34.500
Box Command.

1051
01:24:34.500 --> 01:24:36.625
No sign of the President yet.

1052
01:25:03.000 --> 01:25:05.250
Box Command. we've found them.
[coughing]

1053
01:25:05.250 --> 01:25:07.333
The President's alive.

1054
01:25:07.333 --> 01:25:10.083
[cheering]
Yeah! Yes!

1055
01:25:10.083 --> 01:25:13.291
♪ ♪

1056
01:25:23.250 --> 01:25:24.833
Did I ever tell you?

1057
01:25:24.833 --> 01:25:27.083
I fucking hate funerals.

1058
01:25:29.250 --> 01:25:31.416
[laughs]

1059
01:25:38.041 --> 01:25:39.875
- You OK?
- Yeah.

1060
01:25:41.208 --> 01:25:43.375
Sir. I got you.

1061
01:25:44.250 --> 01:25:45.541
Mr President.

1062
01:25:48.541 --> 01:25:49.666
Banning.

1063
01:25:51.125 --> 01:25:52.500
That all they got?

1064
01:25:53.291 --> 01:25:55.000
Kind of looks like it.

1065
01:26:01.875 --> 01:26:03.166
Lieutenant.

1066
01:26:04.833 --> 01:26:07.666
this could be the
missing link to Barkawi.

1067
01:26:09.000 --> 01:26:10.916
I'll get it to Box
Command right away.

1068
01:26:12.208 --> 01:26:14.875
Next time I tell you
to blow it. just blow it.

1069
01:26:18.833 --> 01:26:20.375
Good job. Lieutenant.

1070
01:26:20.375 --> 01:26:21.875
You too. Banning.

1071
01:26:23.583 --> 01:26:25.125
Safe journey home.

1072
01:26:25.125 --> 01:26:27.333
If that's possible for you.

1073
01:26:59.583 --> 01:27:02.166
(Jacquelin) Next time you wanna
leave town after betraying your

1074
01:27:02.166 --> 01:27:03.708
country. how's about
you steal a car to take

1075
01:27:03.708 --> 01:27:07.333
you to your getaway vehicle?
Preferably one without a GPS.

1076
01:27:07.333 --> 01:27:09.875
'cause that just takes
all the fun out of it.

1077
01:27:15.458 --> 01:27:18.041
You forgot to delete
your access logs.

1078
01:27:18.625 --> 01:27:20.916
Your authorisation code's
there. bright as day.

1079
01:27:24.083 --> 01:27:26.916
The security cameras
show you logging on.

1080
01:27:32.541 --> 01:27:34.375
Just get on the floor.

1081
01:27:37.541 --> 01:27:39.833
Do I have to tell you this
is the most dangerous time

1082
01:27:39.833 --> 01:27:41.750
since the Great War?

1083
01:27:41.750 --> 01:27:45.125
They're cutting budgets while
the barbarians are at the gate.

1084
01:27:46.666 --> 01:27:48.708
The system's failing us. Jax.
It's broken.

1085
01:27:48.708 --> 01:27:51.500
You know it as well as I do.
Things have to change.

1086
01:27:51.875 --> 01:27:53.958
So you thought you'd
teach us all a lesson?

1087
01:27:56.416 --> 01:27:58.375
That and 20 million euros.

1088
01:28:00.541 --> 01:28:02.291
Come with me. Jax.

1089
01:28:03.750 --> 01:28:05.583
Get on the fucking floor.

1090
01:28:17.625 --> 01:28:18.666
John.

1091
01:28:22.125 --> 01:28:24.166
John. get on the floor.

1092
01:28:27.083 --> 01:28:28.541
Get on the floor. John.

1093
01:28:30.291 --> 01:28:32.208
Get on the fucking floor!

1094
01:28:32.708 --> 01:28:34.250
[gunshot]

1095
01:28:35.125 --> 01:28:36.750
[gunshot]

1096
01:28:49.500 --> 01:28:51.041
(Man) Sir?

1097
01:28:57.958 --> 01:28:59.500
Kamran?

1098
01:28:59.500 --> 01:29:03.166
Mr Barkawi?
I thought you'd take my call.

1099
01:29:08.125 --> 01:29:11.833
You think this war. this
war that you started.

1100
01:29:13.333 --> 01:29:15.041
you think it's over?

1101
01:29:17.125 --> 01:29:19.833
I'll dedicate my
life to your death.

1102
01:29:19.833 --> 01:29:21.916
This war will not end.

1103
01:29:24.083 --> 01:29:26.166
Maybe you should
look out your window.

1104
01:29:47.291 --> 01:29:48.875
(Soldier) Clear to proceed.

1105
01:29:48.875 --> 01:29:52.625
Ground asset confirms target
clear of civilian presence.

1106
01:30:17.166 --> 01:30:19.875
(Anchor) Two weeks after the
devastating attacks on the

1107
01:30:19.875 --> 01:30:22.625
British capital. a new
government has been installed

1108
01:30:22.625 --> 01:30:25.583
and the city has
begun to rebuild.

1109
01:30:25.583 --> 01:30:27.541
In the words of Prime
Minister Clarkson.

1110
01:30:27.541 --> 01:30:31.208
'London may have fallen.
but it has always endured

1111
01:30:31.208 --> 01:30:33.583
and will rise again.'

1112
01:30:35.000 --> 01:30:37.875
(Leah) So Daddy's gonna be
taking some more time off.

1113
01:30:37.875 --> 01:30:40.083
Isn't that cool?

1114
01:30:40.083 --> 01:30:42.583
Yeah. maybe it's the new me.

1115
01:30:42.583 --> 01:30:45.083
Or maybe the President insisted.

1116
01:30:46.041 --> 01:30:47.166
Yeah.

1117
01:30:47.166 --> 01:30:48.541
[cries]

1118
01:30:48.541 --> 01:30:50.583
He says he reckons
I've earned a few days off.

1119
01:30:50.583 --> 01:30:52.666
thanks to you. little one.

1120
01:30:52.666 --> 01:30:54.291
[cries]

1121
01:30:54.291 --> 01:30:55.916
Yeah.

1122
01:30:56.583 --> 01:30:58.291
Yeah. it's OK. baby.

1123
01:30:58.291 --> 01:31:00.208
It's OK.

1124
01:31:01.416 --> 01:31:03.125
Yeah. it's OK.

1125
01:31:08.958 --> 01:31:11.958
I wonder what you're gonna
be passionate about. Lynne.

1126
01:31:14.166 --> 01:31:15.416
Yeah.

1127
01:31:16.458 --> 01:31:19.125
(Trumbull) Our hearts go
out to the people of London

1128
01:31:19.125 --> 01:31:21.750
and to our friends
around the world.

1129
01:31:23.041 --> 01:31:26.083
Far too many people
died for no good reason.

1130
01:31:27.583 --> 01:31:30.875
There are those who will say
that this would never have

1131
01:31:30.875 --> 01:31:34.500
happened if we would
just mind our own business.

1132
01:31:35.333 --> 01:31:37.541
Nothing could be
farther from the truth.

1133
01:31:37.541 --> 01:31:41.125
Frankly we live in a dangerous
world and we have few good

1134
01:31:41.125 --> 01:31:45.000
{\an8}options. But the worst
option is to do nothing.

1135
01:31:46.416 --> 01:31:50.583
{\an8}And finally we owe it to our
children and to their children

1136
01:31:50.583 --> 01:31:53.208
to engage in the world.

1137
01:31:54.875 --> 01:31:59.541
God bless you all and God bless
the United States of America.

1138
01:32:00.708 --> 01:32:02.541
(Anchor) That was
Vice President Trumbull live--

1139
01:32:02.541 --> 01:32:05.625
{\an8}♪ ♪

